  "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nI'm setting up the WCS for Setup2.  I've selected a new origin and how I want to change the orientation of the axes.    The UI allows me to Turn X+, X-, Y+... etc.   The issue I have is that these turns are about the World CS.   I don't care about the World CS and its axes.  \n\nI can see the Setup2 CS, it's right in front of me.   I want to turn the setup's CS about the setup's axes, not the world CS axes.   This would be especially so if the World CS is not oblique to the Setup's WCS.\n\n<img width=\"1285\" height=\"810\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ebf2af33-0404-4da0-8583-252d8ae6646e\" />\n\n\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\nMake the Turn functions work around the Setup's WCs, not the World CS.",
